      "y": 844,
      "w": 1440,
      "maxH": 170,
      "text": "The card descriptions now run to three lines, which makes the cards feel heavy. Could we shorten them?\n“Build the skills to become who you want to be.” → “Build skills you can prove.”\n“Turn your expertise into learning that helps others grow.” → “Turn your expertise into learning.”\nAlso, “Set Up an Organization” is a bit long next to the one-word titles. Maybe just “Organization”?",
