      "w": 1440,
      "maxH": 140,
      "text": "Two dates here: the line under the heading says 1 Oct 2026, but the card says 7 October 2026. Which one is right?\nThe name, country and date already sit on the card, so the line could simply be: “Your identity badge now shows on your Creator Profile.”",
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": "s"
    },
    "sug09": {
      "x": 4140,
      "y": 14144,
      "w": 1440,
      "maxH": 140,
      "text": "This message is quite long for the space. Could we try:\n“Your verification wasn’t approved. You can keep drafting. Support can help you finish.”\nThen “You can keep drafting while this is sorted.” under the button wouldn’t be needed.",
      "fill": "orange",
