      "y": 15444,
      "w": 1440,
      "maxH": 360,
      "text": "“Credentials & expertise” shows up three times at the top (top bar, small label and heading), so I’d remove the small label.\nThe intro runs to four lines. Maybe: “Add degrees, certifications, licences or work experience. They show as verified once checked.”\nThe green box could also be shorter: “One verified credential completes this task. Others join your profile once verified.”",
